2. InstallUtil Application Control Test
Objective: Determine whether the Microsoft-signed InstallUtil utility is available to a standard user and permitted by Airlock.
Locate InstallUtil
where.exe /r C:\Windows InstallUtil.exe

Common locations:
C:\Windows\Microsoft.NET\Framework\v4.0.30319\InstallUtil.exe
C:\Windows\Microsoft.NET\Framework64\v4.0.30319\InstallUtil.exe

Confirm Availability and Signature
$paths = @(
"C:\Windows\Microsoft.NET\Framework\v4.0.30319\InstallUtil.exe",
"C:\Windows\Microsoft.NET\Framework64\v4.0.30319\InstallUtil.exe"
)

$paths | ForEach-Object {
