Removable Media Hardening
15. AutoRun / AutoPlay
Objective: Confirm automatic execution from removable media is disabled.
Machine Policy
reg query "HKLM\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Policies\Explorer" /v NoDriveTypeAutoRun
reg query "HKLM\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Policies\Explorer" /v NoAutorun

User Policy
reg query "HKCU\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Policies\Explorer" /v NoDriveTypeAutoRun
reg query "HKCU\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Policies\Explorer" /v NoAutorun

A value such as:
NoDriveTypeAutoRun    REG_DWORD    0xff

indicates AutoRun is disabled for all drive types.
Because USB file ingress is already confirmed, this control is particularly relevant.
PASS: Removable media does not automatically execute content.
FINDING: AutoRun/AutoPlay permits automatic execution from removable media.
